  "template": "<div lang=\"es\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/coleccion/polimero-mundial/republica-dominicana-20-pesos-2009/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"Banco Central de la República Dominicana — 20 Pesos Oro (2009)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/coleccion/polimero-mundial/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Catálogo de Billetes de Polímero Mundial</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Billetes de Polímero Mundial &middot; República Dominicana &middot; 2009</span>\n\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">Banco Central de la República Dominicana</h1>\n\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Veinte Pesos Oro &middot; General Gregorio Luperón &middot; Panteón Nacional</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"dominicana-20-pesos-2009-polimero\"\n            aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/dominicana-bcrd-20-pesos-2009-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/dominicana-bcrd-20-pesos-2009-polimero.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Billete de 20 Pesos Oro de polímero del Banco Central de la República Dominicana, anverso arriba con retrato de Gregorio Luperón, reverso abajo con el Panteón Nacional en Santo Domingo\"\n                width=\"654\"\n                height=\"577\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>\n              Ampliar\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">País</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">República Dominicana</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Entidad Emisora</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Banco Central de la República Dominicana</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denominación</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Veinte Pesos Oro</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Polímero Safeguard&reg; &mdash; el primer billete de polímero emitido en República Dominicana</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Impresor</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">De La Rue (Reino Unido)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Año de Emisión</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">2009<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Firmas</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Héctor Valdez Albizu (Gobernador del Banco Central) &middot; Vicente Bengoa (Secretario de Estado de Finanzas)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensiones</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">130 &times; 67 mm</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Rareza</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Billete corriente, en circulación activa</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Referencia de Catálogo</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-182a, Standard Catalog of World Paper Money<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">3</sup></span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Billete ampliado\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"dominicana-20-pesos-2009-polimero\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Cerrar\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"true\"\n                  aria-label=\"Alejar\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&minus;</button>\n                <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"false\"\n                  aria-label=\"Acercar\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/dominicana-bcrd-20-pesos-2009-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img\n                    src=\"/uploads/dominicana-bcrd-20-pesos-2009-polimero.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Billete de 20 Pesos Oro de polímero del Banco Central de la República Dominicana, vista ampliada\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic;\">Arrastra para mover &middot; Rueda del ratón para ampliar</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Contexto Histórico y de Emisión</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">El primer polímero dominicano:</strong> el Banco Central de la República Dominicana introdujo este billete de 20 Pesos Oro en 2009, el primero del país impreso sobre sustrato de polímero en lugar de papel de algodón tradicional.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Un homenaje al héroe de la Restauración:</strong> el anverso retrata al General Gregorio Luperón (1839&ndash;1897), figura clave del movimiento militar y político que restauró la independencia de República Dominicana.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">4</sup></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Un nombre histórico:</strong> pese a llevar el nombre &ldquo;Pesos Oro&rdquo; &mdash;una convención heredada de la denominación histórica de la moneda&mdash;, el billete corresponde funcionalmente al peso dominicano (DOP) actual.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave Visibles en el Billete</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Anverso:</strong> retrato del General Gregorio Luperón, con flores de caoba y el sello del banco.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">4</sup></span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> el Panteón Nacional en Santo Domingo, lugar de descanso final de los ciudadanos más honrados de la nación, incluido el propio Luperón.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">5</sup></span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Ventana transparente compleja:</strong> gran ventana translúcida con forma de mariposa o reloj de arena, con impresión de seguridad multicolor detallada en sus bordes.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Registro perfecto (see-through):</strong> un pequeño ícono estilizado de flor taína impreso en ambas caras que se alinea perfectamente al trasluz.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Imagen latente:</strong> el numeral &ldquo;20&rdquo; oculto en la geometría del diseño, cerca de la esquina inferior derecha del anverso, visible solo al inclinar el billete.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Fluorescencia UV:</strong> elementos del diseño y la numeración de serie se iluminan bajo luz ultravioleta.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colorido:</strong> subimpreso multicolor en naranja, morado y dorado.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <div style=\"width:100%; margin:44px auto 0; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notas</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">1. Banknote World. &ldquo;Dominican Republic 20 Pesos Oro Banknote, 2009, P-182, UNC, Polymer.&rdquo; <em>banknoteworld.com</em>: billete de 2009 impreso sobre polímero.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">2. Numista. &ldquo;20 Pesos Oro (Polymer) &mdash; Dominican Republic.&rdquo; <em>en.numista.com/204789</em>: firmas de Héctor Valdez Albizu y Vicente Bengoa.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">3. eBay, ficha de catalogación. &ldquo;Dominican Rep P182, Gregorio L&uacute;peron / National Pantheon UNC 2009 POLYMER&rdquo;: &ldquo;Pick&hellip;182.&rdquo;</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">4. Numista, nota #204789: retrato de Gregorio Luperón a la derecha, flores de caoba al centro, sello del banco.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">5. Banknote World. &ldquo;Gregorio Luper&oacute;n &mdash; A Symbol of Resilience in the Dominican Republic.&rdquo; <em>banknoteworld.com/blog</em>: el Pante&oacute;n Nacional en Santo Domingo es el mausoleo nacional donde descansa Luper&oacute;n junto a otros héroes nacionales.</p>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
